      limits="within one VM run; the real transition ring clears at RESET. Semantic DAGs are retained for real revalidation; macros require exact current version/context/goals and are quarantined on mismatch. No disk persistence or autonomous curriculum; reuse counters alone do not prove useful transfer"},
    meta={mechanism="OPWORK/OPGAIN/OPN; useful validated operators receive future proposal effort with forced exploration",
      evidence="all proposal work is paid; no_meta matched ablation",
      limits="only allocation among supplied synthesis operators changes; planner, model language and evaluator remain immutable"},
  },
  authority={
    fixed="VM/ISA/GL; external utility/failure semantics; safe masks and network shield/risk contracts; grammar/operator menu/proposal-production modes/type checks; depth/beam/query caps, dependency allocation rule and goal-distance heuristic; memory and work caps; evaluator and scoring; input schema",
    adaptive="constructed terms, predictive roots, uncertainty/residuals, future-validated memory objects, real action procedures, search allocation",
    self_modification="runtime semantic-changing predictive DAGs and replayed action procedures are interpreted inside a checked sandbox; there is no architecture-level rewrite of the grammar, planner or evaluation semantics",
    host="host compiles the one generic image, advances task physics, scores predictions and computes an offline reporting-only optimum. The host never supplies model proposals, plans or action advice to the guest",
    compiler_optimization="existing equivalent packages remain explicitly separate from cognitive proposals",
  },
  evaluation={
 ["accounting"]={
  ["all_reasoning"]="charged VM instructions and interfaces",
  ["calibration"]="proper Brier quality on actually observed fields; not hidden-state calibration or a confidence certificate",
  ["cpu"]="measured Lua process clock seconds; descriptive and hardware dependent",
  ["g1_trace"]="Earlier G1 matrix primary digests bind VM calls but not full real transcript; one exact-image G1 replay matched work/reward/VM digest and obtained the new combined digest",
  ["images"]="one task-independent image per variant, built before task creation",
  ["macro_counters"]="STATS21 counts selected macro actions before ACT; it equals executed macro actions in clean complete G2 cases, but can overcount a final unexecuted selection in a truncated G1 case",
  ["oracle"]="offline clairvoyant finite-state optimum for reporting only; not a resource-matched reasoning competitor",
  ["rows_digest"]="canonical retained row fields, excluding CPU timings; full variant cases retained below",
  ["stats_aggregation"]="sum of raw per-case STATS; index15 is the sum of per-case maximum search work, not one observed maximum",
  ["trace"]="G2 combined digest binds image, protocol, real world transcript and paid VM trace"
 },
 ["conclusion"]="Measured bounded reasoning mechanisms; full nine-axis doubling is not demonstrated. G2 loses to the preregistered fixed coverage baseline.",
 ["date"]="2026-10-05",
 ["findings"]={
  [1]="G1 no_structure beat full reward; no_hierarchy consumed much less work. The G1 fixed_representation reference stayed passive because exploration was disabled; its comparison is weak.",
  [2]="G2 was registered before its implementation and fresh generic seeds2001..2004. G1 seeds1001..1004 became diagnostic data. Task physics and score definitions were unchanged.",
  [3]="All576 G2 cases completed at all three budgets with zero failures, faults, guards or resource violations. Each variant produced the same decisions/work across budgets; identification score changes with its declared budget denominator.",
  [4]="G2 full reward .2475721571 versus balanced_fixed .2713758681: -8.77% relative reward, with 2.73 times the paid work. The supported seven-axis conditional ratio is .6554266441; it is not a full nine-axis result.",
  [5]="G2 representation/meta/memory ablations earned higher aggregate reward; the implemented mechanisms have not demonstrated aggregate utility gains. Shallow planning earned slightly less reward with less work.",
  [6]="G2 full delayed-credit and latent families had zero OOD recovery and zero early-return retention; symbolic skill was low. Eight accurate future predictions do not establish causal identification or successful delayed planning.",
  [7]="G2 full produced3511 model proposals,1386 constructed terms,8240 future tests,218 installs,61 anomalies and3 rollbacks. These are executed mechanisms, not counts of independently useful algorithm inventions.",
  [8]="G2 memory produced10 executed macro actions and3 observed positive outcomes; no_memory earned higher mean reward. Semantic transfer revalidation occurred36 times, which is not evidence of useful cross-task transfer by itself.",
  [9]="Axis8 prospective useful reasoning proposals remains NA. Model validation or stored procedure counts cannot fill that unsupported axis or create an infinite ratio."
 },
